{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":13.92},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.36,"end":26.64},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.12,"end":39.04}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.88,"text":"分離方法利用物理性質的差異。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.52,"end":7.68,"text":"混合物代表水、溶解的溶質與不溶粒子。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.08,"end":10.96,"text":"實驗必須說明目標是哪種物質；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.44,"end":13.92,"text":"透明液體仍可能含有溶解物。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.36,"end":17.28,"text":"檢查未處理混合物，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.4,"end":18.92,"text":"辨認三種成分。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.2,"end":23.36,"text":"先說明第一個目標是不溶固體還是溶質。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.48,"end":26.64,"text":"透明液體一定只有水嗎？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.12,"end":31.28,"text":"透明液體一定只有水嗎？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.16,"end":35.84,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.4,"end":39.04,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}